- evaluation;
- learning and development;
- non-commercial open-source projects; and
- other lawful non-commercial purposes.

You may:

- use the Software;
- study the Software;
- run the Software;
- copy the Software;
- modify the Software;
- create derivative works;
- privately maintain modified versions; and
- share the Software with others for permitted non-commercial purposes.

